#: includes/components/class-hpve-provider.php:608
msgid "Two checks that cost nothing per lookup. Choose one of them as the Provider above to use it. The applicant types a company number or a VAT number instead of uploading anything, and the register is asked whether that business exists, whether it is still trading and what name is on it. Both prove a business, not a person: someone could type a real company number that is not theirs, so pair them with documents or with an identity provider if that matters on your site. Sole traders below the VAT threshold have neither number, so do not make one of these the only route to a badge unless every Vendor of yours is a registered business."
